  "reference": "Gadiyeeda Giijasoodiga 8",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamwas Sawli miyeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawli ghaghabwas ganiisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba eaweedida ghwanyas ganiiseeda mida Yerusalemu ghabasta haw; ak ghwadarda sean aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Yudeya sea Samariya, ea eaghus giijasoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gaweay fuga mwas ASEETA gabuy Stefano, ak gagutu heareega muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandideani Sawli gagasa gwanyarja ganiisa, aba gideaba iissa gawa jeemba giliwas ghoah ak gooruuta jarooda headiga ea gadeemga ak ghwayiin ghealooniga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geerukwiida Giijasta miy aba Samariya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu fugiga dardaawaadiin gaweay gwarukwiida ng'asheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Filipo mujiineeda Samariya ak gwarukwiisa saawa ng'asheega Gristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gooleeysiit eemeetuw ginyah Filipo, nea geadaah ng'asheega deamdeameadi sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwarina meangeenda munyas jeeda fuga saang'a ghayi ninyas, ak goojuur aba ghuuta haw; ak eara fuga saang'a abitu damealgean ghana fuga badoojiga geahaap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geehoosan muuchi aba mujiineedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi abeeda gwanda siisi siguura Simon ghayi aba mwadi was beeneetkweanda aba mujiineedida ea ghwanung' ghahamng'eanyi fuga ng'eanyiida Samariya, nea gwayi aniini geawooschi siida haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyeesa niny gooleeysiit muuchi buuneeda, ghang'eada siida mwanang' ea ghoah gea hees, nea geeyeena, “Siisi uurda ASEETA siguura uurda haw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geeleeysa iit muuchi aba gideaba nigeawiit inyeesa ghwanung' ghahamng'eanyi buuneeda aba beeneetkweanduumeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghamwas buuneeda giijasta miy bea Filipo bea badayda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA ea gheawunga Yesu Gristo, geepaatiisan sean, headiga ea gadeemga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon eara niny iidu ghamwas, ng'ata giibaatiisandaanyi hean goodeayi Filipo. Ak ghwadaah ng'asheega deamdeameadi ea gwadeagwajeega hees sisin, ak ghahamng'eanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy giijasoodigiga mida Yerusalemuun gideaba fuga Samariya nimwas ng'asheega ASEETA, geecheakta saawa Betaro ea Yohana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaweay ama hita ghamwaash ASEETA aba badahuuka nyaawa gideaba gagasa ghwanyas Guroorooda Ghaydit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba aba damandida mii gwashuubeesa sih aba jeenyaawa, gabeachi gideaba geepaatiisan aba gheawunga Ng'utamiida was Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiin geatinga nyaawa iheengeaba fugiga ak ghwanyas Guroorooda Ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gwajeeng'u Simon gideaba Guroorooda geenyasa iiyiin giijasoodiga geatinga nyaawa buuneeda, hean gageanu ghoadaw lapiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayeesha, “Agooneani eara aniini Uri ak abeeda siida nyooh dayiin geatindeanyu uhuudaanyi ghwanyas Guroorooda Ghaydit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Betaro ak gwayeesha, “Roosiina hoowa ea lapiyeadaang'u, aba gideaba gighayi gilijea nyasa gidaguh ASEETA aba lapiya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ang'iing'i ea mibwaaheasa nea meebareanyeeni aba ng'asheanji, aba gideaba gurooroadaang'u mwadoabiiwa aba madeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi duukuunana searoojisu ikeagwa munyasiin, ak gimwaashi Ng'utamiida, iimuusi, ak gaygwasamseey aba gidigasayi mida jeeda guroroadaang'uuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba naadaayi gindi jeeda lachng'eanyiida ng'waan ea jeeda ghealooniga aba badayda munyinda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Simon ak gwayeesha, “Eaniyean amwaasha ASEETA aba badaydeanyu aba heeda Ng'utamiida, ak ea adaghwanyasan gida wassean aba jeedeaba ng'asheesu ooruguun.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa iinimuuwu ng'asheega nyaawa ea rukwiideayda ng'asheanda Ng'utamiida, gabiikta Yerusalemu, ak gwarukwiida giijasta miy aba gharang'weaka saang'a bea ng'eanyiida Samariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Filipo sea siida haw bea Guushi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha malaykajeanda Ng'utamiida Filipo, “Ng'eada ak guwi wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara was bwalbwaleeda leabu Yerusalemu gal Gasa.” Nea naweani ea eeshtearajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat ak gawa. Deagheata ghwadaah siida ng'eanyiida Guushi was gulaneeda, ak ea siida haw ambal Gandakeehi was sugoocheanda was gatmooda bea ng'eanyiida Guushi, ambal eara maghastaanyi, hean ghwaan Yerusalemu ghaghadoawan ASEETA ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.8.27"
            ]
