          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghafwach Filipo gawa murdeadaanyi, ak ghwayiiy nea ghoasoamwa siidida gitaabooda sibaneeda siguura Isaya, ak ghoanyaash, “Heapi, ng'asheesu iisoamwaniin ginali?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.30",
